ra2-modern-hezbollah-name = Hezbollah
ra2-modern-hezbollah-description = Fictional RTS faction: light mobile forces, concealed defenses and guided rockets.
    Includes economy, production, land, air, naval and support buildings.
    New local development roster; balance and final art approval pending.

levant-r2hzrifle-name = Line Fighter
levant-r2hzrifle-description = Inexpensive rifle infantry. Conceals while stationary; moving, firing or taking damage reveals it. Detectors and artillery defeat isolated positions.

levant-r2hzat-name = Ridge Missile Team
levant-r2hzat-description = Light anti-armor missile infantry. A signal post or scout improves range and reload. Vulnerable to infantry, detectors and air attacks.

levant-r2hzspotter-name = Field Spotter
levant-r2hzspotter-description = Reconnaissance specialist who detects cloaked units and guides nearby eligible missile teams and vehicles. A weak weapon makes escorts essential.

levant-r2hzscout-name = Cedar Scout
levant-r2hzscout-description = One concealed scout with a suppressed carbine and demolition ability. Stationary concealment breaks when firing, moving or damaged. Vulnerable once detected.

levant-r2hztechnical-name = Cedar Technical
levant-r2hztechnical-description = Fast and inexpensive machine-gun vehicle. Strong against exposed infantry, weak against armor and air attacks.

levant-r2hzrecoilless-name = Recoilless Technical
levant-r2hzrecoilless-description = Mobile anti-armor fire on a fragile chassis. Signal coverage improves range and reload. Infantry and aircraft punish exposed vehicles.

levant-r2hzescort-name = Escort Gun Truck
levant-r2hzescort-description = Fragile mobile anti-air escort. Its ground fire discourages infantry; tanks and artillery counter it.

levant-r2hzrockets-name = Mobile Rocket Battery
levant-r2hzrockets-description = Long-range rocket artillery with a minimum range and a slow reload. Must stop to set up its stabilized firing cycle. Scouts or signal posts improve guided fire; close attacks force withdrawal.

levant-r2hzdrone-name = Loiter Drone
levant-r2hzdrone-description = One-way airborne attack that consumes the drone. Scout the target first. Anti-air fire destroys it before impact.

levant-r2hzmissileboat-name = Coastal Missile Boat
levant-r2hzmissileboat-description = Light guided-missile craft. Coverage from a scout boat supports coordinated fire; poor armor demands spacing and an escort.

levant-r2hzskiff-name = Attack Skiff
levant-r2hzskiff-description = Inexpensive one-way attack boat. Requires a reachable water target and is consumed on impact. Patrol screens and concentrated fire counter it.

levant-r2hzsurvey-name = Coastal Survey Boat
levant-r2hzsurvey-description = Light patrol and reconnaissance craft with sonar and fleet guidance. Prioritize its sensors; heavy warships outgun it.

levant-r2hzbunker-name = Concealed Bunker
levant-r2hzbunker-description = Stationary concealed machine-gun defense. Firing or taking damage reveals it. Detection and artillery counter the position.

levant-r2hzaanest-name = Short-Range AA Nest
levant-r2hzaanest-description = Low-cost anti-air emplacement. Cannot substitute for armor defense. Artillery attacks outside its range.

levant-r2hzcoastal-name = Coastal Missile Emplacement
levant-r2hzcoastal-description = Concealed missile defense against ground vehicles and ships. Minimum range leaves a close-attack window. Detection and infantry counter it.

# Original project faction names and descriptions.

ra2-r2hzrifle-name = Mountain Rifleman
ra2-r2hzrifle-description = Inexpensive two-shot ambush infantry. Camouflages while
    stationary; firing, moving or damage reveals him.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2hzat-name = RPG Hunter
ra2-r2hzat-description = Short-range anti-armor rockets. Near a Drone Spotter: +20%
    range and 20% faster reloads.
    Weak vs infantry and aircraft.

ra2-r2hzspotter-name = Drone Spotter
ra2-r2hzspotter-description = Long sight and cloak detection. Guides nearby RPG Hunters and
    missile trucks; guidance does not stack.
    Weak carbine; requires radar.

ra2-r2hzscout-name = Wadi Ghost
ra2-r2hzscout-description = Infiltrator who stays camouflaged while moving. Suppressed
    double-tap, C4 and a remote charge that detonates on
    structures after 3 seconds. Maximum one.

ra2-r2hztechnical-name = Armed Technical
ra2-r2hztechnical-description = Fast, cheap machine-gun raider. Strong vs infantry;
    very weak vs armor. Strike exposed targets and relocate.

ra2-r2hzrecoilless-name = Recoilless Technical
ra2-r2hzrecoilless-description = Fast pickup with a recoilless anti-armor rifle.
    Hits hard but has almost no armor.

ra2-r2hzescort-name = ZU-23 Technical
ra2-r2hzescort-description = Mobile twin-cannon air defense. Cannot attack ground targets.
    Light armor.

ra2-r2hzrockets-name = Mobile Missile Launcher
ra2-r2hzrockets-description = Long-range missile truck with a 5-cell minimum range. The empty
    erector shows the long reload. Drone guidance extends range and
    shortens reloads. Requires radar.

ra2-r2hzdrone-name = Samad Drone
ra2-r2hzdrone-description = One-way loitering munition. Consumed by its terminal dive;
    strongest vs structures. Vulnerable to anti-air. Requires radar.

ra2-r2hzmissileboat-name = Hodeidah Missile Craft
ra2-r2hzmissileboat-description = Anti-ship and coastal missiles; turns to fire. Firing reveals
    it for 8 seconds. Surveillance links add 20% range and
    12% damage. Requires radar.

ra2-r2hzskiff-name = Sahaab USV
ra2-r2hzskiff-description = Cheap explosive surface drone, destroyed by its attack.
    Moves only inside a surveillance link or shipyard relay.
    Vulnerable to fast patrol craft.

ra2-r2hzsurvey-name = Mokha Surveillance Craft
ra2-r2hzsurvey-description = Links USVs and coordinates missile fire within 6 cells.
    Deploy active radar for a 14-cell link and wider sensors;
    emission reveals it. Detects submarines. Requires radar.

ra2-r2hzbunker-name = Mountain Bunker
ra2-r2hzbunker-description = Camouflaged machine-gun nest; firing, damage or low power reveals it.
    Requires power. Weak vs armor.

ra2-r2hzaanest-name = ZU-23 Nest
ra2-r2hzaanest-description = Twin-cannon air defense. Cannot attack ground targets.
    Requires radar and power.

ra2-r2hzcoastal-name = Coastal Missile Battery
ra2-r2hzcoastal-description = Camouflaged anti-ship and anti-vehicle missiles; firing, damage
    or low power reveals it. Minimum range: 3 cells. Surveillance links add range.
    Requires radar and power.
levant-r2hzrelay-name = Signal Post
levant-r2hzrelay-description = Powered six-cell support and five-cell cloak detection. Eligible guided units gain range and reload bonuses; bonuses do not stack.
levant-r2hzworkshop-name = Field Workshop
levant-r2hzworkshop-description = Powered four-cell repair zone for eligible vehicles. Repairs two health per second only below 70% health. Bonuses do not stack; protect this unarmed structure.
